docs {
Cek status bookmark batch by word_ids (16-api-bookmark.md) - state tombol
bookmark di halaman detail kata. Mode ini TANPA meta pagination (has_more
selalu implisit false). Login wajib (semua role).

200 sukses (hanya kata yang di-bookmark user yang muncul):

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": [
        { "word_id": "01J...", "bookmarked_at": "2026-09-20T03:00:00.000Z", "word": { "id": "01J...", "lemma": "makatn", "word_type": "word", "is_verified": true } }
      ]
    }

400 word_ids kosong / lebih dari 50 / bukan ULID; 401 tanpa token.
}

meta {
  name: Get My Bookmarks Filtered
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookmarks/my?word_ids={{word_id}}
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{contributor_access_token}}
}

tests {
  test("200 + hanya kata yang di-bookmark user, tanpa meta", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data).to.be.an("array");
    expect(res.body.meta).to.be.undefined;
  });
}
